# Raw k6 JSON outputs grow to multiple GB for a 30-minute 1000-VU run
# (each iteration logs every HTTP request to the stream). Gzipped they
# still exceed GitHub's 100 MB single-file limit. The plan's D-EXEC-2
# mandate is satisfied by committing the human-readable summary JSON
# (~164 KB) + RUN-LOG.md per-endpoint p95 table. Raw outputs stay
# locally for forensic re-analysis.
#
# Operators who need to ship raw outputs for cross-team review should
# enable git-lfs and rebind these patterns to `lfs filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text`
# in .gitattributes.
#
# Patterns target ONLY the timestamp-prefixed top-level k6 raw outputs.
# Per-run diagnostics (containers-mid-mock.json, migrate-failure.log,
# etc.) live under {mock,realistic}/diagnostics/ and ARE committed.
20*-mock.json
20*-mock.json.gz
20*-realistic.json
20*-realistic.json.gz
mock/run.log
mock/.start
realistic/run.log
realistic/.start
